## 🚀 Quick Start

1. Download the Free GTA VI Launcher package using the official information link above.
2. Extract the downloaded archive to a folder on your Windows desktop.
3. Run the executable as Administrator to open the launcher companion.

The main interface opens with official store links, platform details, and installation guidance.

## 💻 Requirements

| Component | Requirement |
|---|---|
| OS | Windows 10 / 11, 64-bit |
| RAM | 4 GB minimum |
| Storage | 500 MB for the companion |
| Privileges | Administrator |

**Game platform note:** GTA VI is currently available for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. Rockstar has not listed a Windows PC version. The companion provides information and official links; it does not install the console game on Windows.

