## 📖 Launcher Guide

### 1. Check Game Availability
Open the official Rockstar GTA VI page and confirm the supported platform. The currently listed platforms are PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S.

### 2. Select Your Edition
Compare Standard and Ultimate Edition details on the official store pages before purchasing.

### 3. Open the Correct Store
Use the PlayStation Store for PS5 or Microsoft Store for Xbox. Make sure the selected version matches your console.

### 4. Prepare Storage
Check your console's available storage before starting the download. Rockstar lists up to 212 GB of required space.

### 5. Download the Game
Open your console library or store, select GTA VI, and start the official installation.

### 6. Redeem Your Game Code
If you purchased a digital code, redeem it through the appropriate platform account. Check regional compatibility before activation.

### 7. Launch GTA VI
After the download and required updates finish, start the game from your console library.

